90">faster </span><span begin="00:30.990" end="00:32.833">everyday</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:32.540" end="00:39.050"><span begin="00:32.540" end="00:33.530">If </span><span begin="00:33.530" end="00:33.780">only </span><span begin="00:33.780" end="00:34.350">time </span><span begin="00:34.350" end="00:35.030">flew </span><span begin="00:35.030" end="00:36.240">like </span><span begin="00:36.240" end="00:36.500">a </span><span begin="00:36.500" end="00:39.047">dove</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:38.750" end="00:50.190"><span begin="00:38.750" end="00:39.680">We </span><span begin="00:39.680" end="00:40.150">gotta </span><span begin="00:40.150" end="00:40.780">make </span><span begin="00:40.780" end="00:41.150">it </span><span begin="00:41.150" end="00:42.540">fly </span><span begin="00:42.540" end="00:42.800">faster </span><span begin="00:42.800" end="00:43.200">than </span><span begin="00:43.200" end="00:43.590">i'm </span><span begin="00:43.590" end="00:44.090">falling </span><span begin="00:44.090" end="00:44.220">in </span><span begin="00:44.220" end="00:50.181">love</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:51.270" end="00:58.140"><span begin="00:51.270" end="00:52.040">This </span><span begin="00:52.040" end="00:53.220">time </span><span begin="00:53.220" end="00:53.420">we're </span><span begin="00:53.420" end="00:53.630">not </span><span begin="00:53.630" end="00:53.950">giving </span><span begin="00:53.950" end="00:58.136">up</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:57.840" end="01:02.760"><span begin="00:57.840" end="00:58.370">Let's </span><span begin="00:58.370" end="00:58.680">make </span><span begin="00:58.680" end="00:58.930">it </span><span begin="00:58.930" end="00:59.410">last </span><span begin="00:59.410" end="01:02.755">forever</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:02.460" end="01:10.770"><span begin="01:02.460" end="01:03.100">Screaming </span><span begin="01:03.100" end="01:10.762">hallelujah</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:10