 </span><span begin="01:40.990" end="01:41.490">looking </span><span begin="01:41.490" end="01:48.750">on</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:48.450" end="01:55.380"><span begin="01:48.450" end="01:49.900">This </span><span begin="01:49.900" end="01:50.250">time </span><span begin="01:50.250" end="01:50.540">we're </span><span begin="01:50.540" end="01:50.910">not </span><span begin="01:50.910" end="01:51.310">giving </span><span begin="01:51.310" end="01:55.376">up</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:55.080" end="01:59.900"><span begin="01:55.080" end="01:55.630">Let's </span><span begin="01:55.630" end="01:55.940">make </span><span begin="01:55.940" end="01:56.290">it </span><span begin="01:56.290" end="01:56.730">last </span><span begin="01:56.730" end="01:59.895">forever</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:59.600" end="02:08.030"><span begin="01:59.600" end="02:01.510">Screaming </span><span begin="02:01.510" end="02:08.022">hallelujah</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:07.730" end="02:20.200"><span begin="02:07.730" end="02:08.300">We'll </span><span begin="02:08.300" end="02:08.700">make </span><span begin="02:08.700" end="02:09.090">it </span><span begin="02:09.090" end="02:09.700">last </span><span begin="02:09.700" end="02:20.195">forever</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:19.900" end="02:26.930"><span begin="02:19.900" end="02:20.480">And </span><span begin="02:20.480" end="02:20.810">we've </span><span begin="02:20.810" end="02:21.200">got </span><span begin="02:21.200" end="02:22.500">time </span><span begin="02:22.500" end="02:22.710">on </span><span begin="02:22.710" end="02:23.400">our </span><span begin="02:23.400" end="02:26.927">hands</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:26.630" end="02:30.470"><span begin="02:26.630" end="02:27.210">And </span><span begin="02:27.210" end="02:27.950">we've </span><span begin="02:27.950" end="02:28.580">got </span><span begin="02:28.580" end="02:28.840">got </span><span begin="02:28.840" end="02:29.090">nothing </span><span begin="02:29.090" end="02:29.330">but </span><span begin="02:29.330" end="02:29.540">time </span><span begin="02:29.540" end="02:29.750">on </span><span begin="02:29.750" end="02:29.950">our </span><span begin="02:29.950" end="02:30.470">hands</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:30.170" end="02:32.710"><span begin="02:30.170" end="02:30.680">Got </span><span begin="02:30.680" end="02:30.940">nothing </span><span begin="02:30.940" end="02:31.350">but </span><span begin="02:31.350" end="02:32.010">got </span><span begin="02:32.010" end="02:32.300">nothing </span><span begin="02:32.300" end="02:32.706">but</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:32.410" end="02:42.410"><span begin="02:32.410" end="02:33.040">Got </span><span begin="02:33.040" end="02:33.440">nothing </span><span begin="02:33.440" end="02:34.220">but </span><span begin="02:34.220" end="02:35.020">time </span><span begin="02:35.020" end="02:35.430">on </span><span begin="02:35.430" end="02:35.670">our </span><span begin="02:35.670" end="02:42.407">hands</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:48.160" end="02:52.960"><span begin="02:48.160" end="02:48.690">This </span><span begin="02:48.690" end="02:49.020">time </span><span begin="02:49.020" end="02:49.350">we're </span><span begin="02:49.350" end="02:49.620">not </span><span begin="02:49.620" end="02:49.870">giving </span><span begin="02:49.870" end="02:52.956">up</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:52.660" end="02:58.800"><span begin="02:52.660" end="02:54.450">Oh </span><span begin="02:54.450" end="02:54.670">let's </span><span begin="02:54.670" end="02:54.870">make </span><span begin="02:54.870" end="02:55.170">it </span><span begin="02:55.170" end="02:55.540">last </span><span begin="02:55.540" end="02:58.796">forever</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:58.500" end="03:06.760"><span begin="02:58.500" end="03:00.440">Screaming </span><span begin="03:00.440" end="03:06.752">hallelujah</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:06.46